A: Кра́сный дом, бе́лая кни́га: you've had colours since lesson twelve.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name known1

    erase known1

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: Today: (@draw j_black@) clothes, four (@draw j_red@) more colours, (@draw j_white@) and who's wearing what. First, listen: I ask Masha where Ivan is.

A: Ма́ша, где Ива́н?
    draw balloon_t bt_name caption false

    erase balloon_t bt_name

B: Ива́н? Он в кафе́, в кра́сной ку́ртке.
    draw balloon_m bm_name caption false

    erase balloon_m bm_name

    ask "Which jacket is Ivan wearing? Listen for the colour, and tap it." voice b on ["j_black","j_red","j_white"] correct 2 pool false
        gloss: Ivan? He's at the café, in a red jacket.
        listen: Ива́н? Он в кафе́, в кра́сной ку́ртке.
        right: The red one: в кра́сной ку́ртке.
        wrong: Listen for a colour you know from lesson twelve.

    erase j_black j_white

A: Ку́ртка is new: a jacket. Кра́сная ку́ртка, a red jacket.
    draw kurtka

B: And в here means wearing: Ivan is in a red jacket.
    draw v_kurtke

    erase kurtka

A: It's the place ending of lesson fifty-eight: в большо́й кварти́ре, в кра́сной ку́ртке.
    draw ref58

A: Ой on the colour, е on the jacket.
    highlight v_kurtke color #d0865f part ой$ effect underline

    erase j_red v_kurtke ref58

B: Руба́шка, a shirt. Жёлтая руба́шка.
    draw rail h1 g_shirt l_shirt_a l_shirt_n

A: Пла́тье, a dress, is an оно́-word, so green ends in ое: зелёное пла́тье.
    draw h2 g_dress l_dress_a l_dress_n

B: Брю́ки, trousers, are always plural, as in English: си́ние брю́ки.
    draw h3 g_trousers l_trousers_a l_trousers_n

A: О́бувь is footwear: shoes and boots. Words in ь can be he or she; о́бувь is a she-word: чёрная о́бувь.
    draw g_shoes l_shoes_a l_shoes_n

B: Жёлтый, зелёный, чёрный: they go like кра́сный.
    highlight l_shirt_a l_dress_a l_shoes_a color #5b8c5a effect underline

A: Only си́ний, blue, is (@draw siniy@) soft: си́няя, си́нее, си́ние, with я and е.

    erase rack

    show tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: To say what you have on, start with на мне: on me.
    draw m_dress m_jacket t_shirt

B: На мне зелёное пла́тье и си́няя ку́ртка.
    draw na_mne

A: After на мне, the clothes keep their plain form.
    highlight na_mne color #5b8c5a effect underline

A: With в, they take the place ending: (@draw v_platye@) Ма́ша в зелёном пла́тье.

A: Пла́тье already ends in е, so it stays, like мо́ре.
    highlight v_platye color #5b8c5a part пла́тье effect underline

B: А Том в жёлтой руба́шке.
    draw v_rubashke

    erase v_platye v_rubashke

B: And my jacket? Си́ний is soft, so not ой (@draw v_siney@) but ей: в си́ней ку́ртке.

    erase m_dress m_jacket t_shirt na_mne v_platye v_rubashke v_siney

A: Tonight we're going out, and Masha is getting dressed. Listen, then practise it.

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk_1 talk_2

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk_3 talk_4

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

    draw q_dress

    quiz "A green dress: which is right?" reveal.text "зелёное пла́тье" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 250 reveal.style label reveal.size 56 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Зелёное: пла́тье is an оно́-word, so ое.
        wrong: Пла́тье is an оно́-word, like окно́.
        + зелёное пла́тье
        * зелёный пла́тье
        * зелёная пла́тье

    erase q_dress

    draw q_shirt

    quiz "She's wearing a white shirt: Она́ в ___ Which fits?" reveal.text "в бе́лой руба́шке" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 250 reveal.style label reveal.size 56 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: В бе́лой руба́шке: after в, ой on the colour and е on the shirt.
        wrong: After в, both words change: think of в кра́сной ку́ртке.
        * бе́лая руба́шка
        * бе́лой руба́шка
        + бе́лой руба́шке

    erase q_shirt

    draw q_ear

    ask "What colour are the trousers?" voice b options ["black","blue","green"] correct 2 test t1
        gloss: I've got blue trousers and a white shirt on.
        listen: На мне си́ние брю́ки и бе́лая руба́шка.
        right: Blue: си́ние брю́ки.
        wrong: Listen for the word just before брю́ки.

    erase q_ear

    draw q_jacket

    ask say_it "Я бу́ду в кра́сной ку́ртке." gloss "I'll be in a red jacket." voice b show cue reveal.text "Я бу́ду в кра́сной ку́ртке." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 250 reveal.style label reveal.size 56 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1

    erase q_jacket

    draw q_ivan q_jblack

    ask "Now build a sentence. Type: Ivan is in a black jacket (Ива́н в …)." answer ["иван в чёрной куртке","иван в черной куртке","иван одет в чёрную куртку","иван одет в черную куртку"] reveal.text "Ива́н в чёрной ку́ртке" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 250 reveal.style label reveal.size 56 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Ива́н в чёрной ку́ртке: в, then ой and е.
        wrong: Start with Ива́н в, then чёрная ку́ртка with the place ending.

    erase q_ivan q_jblack

    draw board

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So the colour copies its clothes: зелёное пла́тье, си́ние брю́ки.
    highlight b1 color #5b8c5a effect underline

A: On me, the plain form; wearing, в and the place ending: в кра́сной ку́ртке.
    highlight b3 color #d0865f effect underline

    erase board

B: Ива́н в кра́сной ку́ртке, и я в кра́сном! Пока́!
