    '|a||Clothes in Russian: в кра́сной ку́ртке':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4240
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Name clothes and four new colours in Russian, and say who is wearing what: на мне зелёное пла́тье, Ива́н в кра́сной ку́ртке.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1tglm0j'
    '|a||Кра́сный дом, бе́лая кни́га: you''ve had colours since lesson twelve.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5600
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Today: clothes, four more colours, and who''s wearing what. First, listen: I ask Masha where Ivan is.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1555xz8'
    '|a||Ма́ша, где Ива́н?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:yf5axf'
    '|b||Ива́н? Он в кафе́, в кра́сной ку́ртке.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3280
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1q5niz6'
    '|a||Which jacket is Ivan wearing? Listen for the colour, and tap it.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4720
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||The red one: в кра́сной ку́ртке.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Ку́ртка is new: a jacket. Кра́сная ку́ртка, a red jacket.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6200
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||And в here means wearing: Ivan is in a red jacket.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5160
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:nh3cf6'
    '|a||It''s the place ending of lesson fifty-eight: в большо́й кварти́ре, в кра́сной ку́ртке.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:198e5pr'
    '|a||Ой on the colour, е on the jacket.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1mmodsu'
    '|b||Руба́шка, a shirt. Жёлтая руба́шка.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3840
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:12kc43i'
    '|a||Пла́тье, a dress, is an оно́-word, so green ends in ое: зелёное пла́тье.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1gcge5w'
    '|b||Брю́ки, trousers, are always plural, as in English: си́ние брю́ки.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6120
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1s1au4e'
    '|a||О́бувь is footwear: shoes and boots. Words in ь can be he or she; о́бувь is a she-word: чёрная о́бувь.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1520lc6'
    '|b||Жёлтый, зелёный, чёрный: they go like кра́сный.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3720
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:8s6xr9'
    '|a||Only си́ний, blue, is soft: си́няя, си́нее, си́ние, with я and е.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1e5fi1b'
    '|a||To say what you have on, start with на мне: on me.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:152seet'
    '|b||На мне зелёное пла́тье и си́няя ку́ртка.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4000
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:bd1eoq'
    '|a||After на мне, the clothes keep their plain form.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1cgbzln'
    '|a||With в, they take the place ending: Ма́ша в зелёном пла́тье.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:t0mefn'
    '|a||Пла́тье already ends in е, so it stays, like мо́ре.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1q2wiei'
    '|b||А Том в жёлтой руба́шке.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2600
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:i23vi'
    '|b||And my jacket? Си́ний is soft, so not ой but ей: в си́ней ку́ртке.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7320
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1p3wi42'
    '|a||Tonight we''re going out, and Masha is getting dressed. Listen, then practise it.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:13kpblc'
    '|a||Five questions now, then your score. A green dress: which is right?':
