      ms: 5320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:16e4y8e'
    '|a||Зелёное: пла́тье is an оно́-word, so ое.':
